@startuml graph-update
title US-05: Graph Update - Proximity Event Written to Neo4j and proximity.candidates Published

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

participant "Correlation\nWorker" as Correlation
database "Neo4j\nentity graph" as Neo4j
queue "Kafka\nproximity.candidates" as ProxKafka

Correlation -> Neo4j : MERGE (a:Entity {id: $id_a})\nMERGE (b:Entity {id: $id_b})

note over Neo4j
  MERGE creates the node if absent,
  matches it if already present.
  Entity nodes are never duplicated.
end note

note over Correlation
  pair_key = min(entity_a_id, entity_b_id) + ':' + max(entity_a_id, entity_b_id)
  episode_start_ms = from proximity-episode hash (set when episode began)
  idempotency_key = {pair_key}:{episode_start_ms}
  One edge per proximity episode, not one per ping.
end note

Correlation -> Neo4j : MERGE (a)-[e:PROXIMITY_EVENT {\n  idempotency_key: $pair_key + ':' + $episode_start_ms\n}]->(b)\nON CREATE SET\n  e.episode_start_ms = $episode_start_ms,\n  e.last_seen_ms = $now_ms,\n  e.distance_at_detection = $distance,\n  e.lat = $lat,\n  e.lon = $lon\nON MATCH SET\n  e.last_seen_ms = $now_ms,\n  e.min_distance_metres = CASE\n    WHEN $distance < e.min_distance_metres\n    THEN $distance ELSE e.min_distance_metres END

note over Neo4j
  Idempotency key = {pair_key}:{episode_start_ms}.
  Replaying the same Kafka event matches the existing edge — no duplicate.
  ON MATCH updates keep last_seen_ms and min_distance_metres current
  during an ongoing episode.
  Safe to replay from any offset.
end note

Neo4j --> Correlation : edge created or updated (no-op on idempotent replay)

Correlation -> ProxKafka : publish proximity.candidates\n{ pair_key, entity_a_id, entity_b_id,\n  episode_start_ms, timestamp_ms,\n  lat, lon, distance_at_detection }

note over ProxKafka
  Published only on episode start (not on each ping).
  Published only for unscheduled pairs
  (no KNOWN_ASSOCIATE edge).
  Known associates: Neo4j edge written, no Kafka event.
  Alert Evaluator consumes this topic
  to emit UNSCHEDULED_PROXIMITY and COMPOSITE alerts.
  Short retention (1h) — stale candidates have no value.
end note

@enduml
